' === NOTES ===
note bottom of UC31
**Product Dashboard Displays:**
• Total products count
• Low stock alerts
• Recent bookings
• Today's revenue
• Best selling products
end note

note bottom of UC32
**Add New Product:**
1. Select category (Live/Fresh/Supply)
2. Fill details (name, price, description)
3. Upload photos (min 1, max 10)
4. Set initial stock
5. Set shipping info (for supplies)
end note

note bottom of UC37
**Approve/Reject Booking:**
1. Review customer inquiry details
2. Check animal health status
3. Approve → Assign visit schedule
4. Reject → Provide reason
5. Send notification to customer
end note

note bottom of UC47
**Care Record Types:**
• Feeding: Feed schedule & quantity
• Vaccination: Vaccine name, date, batch
• Health Check: Weight, condition, notes
• Cleaning: Cage cleaning schedule
end note

note bottom of UC40
**Farm Profile Completion:**
• Basic info (name, description, address)
• Location & GPS coordinates
• Photos & gallery (min 3 photos)
• Verification badge (by admin)
• Operating hours
end note

